WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.440
I'm Hatonami Ayame.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.980
I'm not all that good at talking,

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.110
but my father is Japanese 
and my mother is Chinese.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.830
My parents lived apart when I was a child

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.100
and, in order to raise me,

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.930
my mother worked as live-in staff 
at a relative's Chinese restaurant.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.960
While I was there, I learned Chinese 
martial arts from the restaurant owner.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.810
The weapons I'm best with are these tonfa.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:42.390
The reason my parents got divorced 
was because my father was yakuza.

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:49.440
That's why I really wanted to become a cop.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:53.080
But, in this world,

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:57.390
I have no idea what's right anymore.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.500
<b>"Dream Road to Death"</b>

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.850
F-Food's r-ready!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:56.340
It's always katsu curry 
when you're making it, huh?

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.540
Katsu curry again?

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.920
How do you always end up with katsu curry

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:07.770
when you use different 
ingredients each time, Sakuma?

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.000
I-It's nutritious!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.710
You mean high in calories.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.380
Hey, Guren!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:24.820
How'd it go?

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.240
No good.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.390
There wasn't a soul there.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.400
Katsu curry again?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:38.140
There are a lot fewer normal people around.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:43.640
Though, we're starting 
to run out of food, too.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.300
What should we do?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.960
All right!

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:56.300
Let's go try for a rematch!

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.210
Against those guys?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.270
There's only one main road around here.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.240
We'll catch up with them in no time.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.450
T-Time for our bombs, then!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.190
If you use those
you'll blast the food away, too,

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.030
so back off.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.210
Yoshinaga, what's this?

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.160
Oh.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.480
This machine works in conjunction with a map

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:55.830
to tell us where we are 
and how to get where we're going.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.310
You have such conveniences now?

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.510
This is unusual.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:08.440
You starting to gain an interest 
in western stuff now?

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:13.010
Yeah. I never imagined 
such a thing could exist.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.230
Is that...?

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.280
What's the matter?

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:51.930
It would seem we're being followed.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.160
What?!

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.810
We found you!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.240
Your time has finally come!

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.590
Huh?!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.560
Dad?!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:13.650
Huh?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.880
These guys?!

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:31.690
<i>How were they able to 
follow us so precisely?</i>

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:46.460
Guren! Stop their ride for us!

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:55.110
Leave it to me, Boss!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.010
What is that?

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.850
Wh-What on earth is that?

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.130
What is that?

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.870
That's...!

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.500
Meteora?!

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.880
It was still alive?!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.430
What is it doing all the way out here?!

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.480
Everyone, look!

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.840
The Meteora's form!

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.500
It's human-shaped?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.470
What?!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.050
What?!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.330
Open up, Yoshinaga!

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.100
Yukinojyo!

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:32.870
Rescue them from the vehicle first!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.130
Kenroku, let's go!

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:37.790
Yeah!

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:42.890
Don't let your guard down, either of you!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.330
Sensui!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.370
Bear with it, Kenroku!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.110
We're luring it away!

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.190
<i>Sensui, Kenroku!</i>

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.090
Here it comes!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.230
This Gibia, Meteora,

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:46.580
doesn't seem all that obsessed 
with getting its stinger into us.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:50.790
Feels like it's different 
from the other Gibia.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:56.210
Not to mention, it didn't die after 
we made it fall from so high up.

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.620
How are we supposed to defeat it?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:08.870
Shall we try keeping up constant 
attacks between the two of us?

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:14.360
So, just fight it like normal?

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:07.300
This one's in a pretty sorry state.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.280
Ayame-chan.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.500
Was that your father?

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.360
It was.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.660
I thought about arresting him,

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:51.240
but if he gets himself killed like that, 
that works, too.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.510
Are you okay with that?

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:57.270
He's your father, you know.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.810
Are you sure you're okay with that?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:08.140
My father's already dead, you know!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:13.400
I'm jealous of the fact yours is alive, 
and you can do something about it!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:23.690
Arresting your father can't be 
your only purpose in life.

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:29.500
Such a sad thing could never be true.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:33.970
Ayame-san.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.420
You should be more honest with yourself.

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:51.670
Mom! Mom!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.110
Ayame.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:59.240
Mom! Hang in there!

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:11.700
Mom! You've been stung 
by a Gibia, haven't you?!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.950
Ayame...

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.400
Do it before I become a Gibia,

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.360
please.

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:32.050
A... ya... me...

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:58.880
Mom!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.210
Sensui!

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.510
Eat this!

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:25.290
Kenroku.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:29.070
Don't worry about it. The next one's coming.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:46.510
Heave ho!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.710
This Gibia...

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:11.070
Is it trying to talk?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.830
Ayame-kun! Be careful!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.830
That monster isn't like the rest!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.210
I have an idea.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.340
Ayame-san! I'm coming, too!

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:40.590
I'll be fine. I can do this myself.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:48.000
I'm going to do what I can.

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:12.300
Come on, over here!

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.590
That brat!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:19.010
He's getting carried away again!

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.150
Eat this!

00:17:57.640 --> 00:18:00.270
Did we get him?

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.560
You did it!

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:07.560
You did it, you did it!

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:14.320
We'll pull back for today.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.110
Cut it out, already!

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:25.380
Aren't you ashamed of attacking 
survivors to steal their stuff

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:29.300
when the world's like this?!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.600
Keep this up, and you're just an old scumbag!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:39.570
If you're going to fight anything, 
fight Gibia, not people!

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:43.300
Ayame... Your mother...?

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.390
Mom died!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.810
She was killed by Gibia!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.410
Wha?!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:51.250
So, why are you here attacking people?!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.310
Your enemy is the Gibia, isn't it?!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:55.830
Get your revenge!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.600
Ayame...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:02.190
Even if I arrested you all, 
 there's no prison right now.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:07.250
I'm not going to kill you, so just get lost!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.010
And never show your face before me again!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.920
Sensui!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.400
Sensui!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.690
Sensui?!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:46.030
Ayame, are you okay with that?

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.450
Hmm? I guess.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:53.380
Hey, Sensui-kun... Your injury... it's awful.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:58.960
We need to stop the bus somewhere 
and rest for two or three days.

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:03.830
He's been under great strain, 
with all we've been through.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.610
He's even developed a fever.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.240
Sensui.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:19.930
Oh, there's a food factory nearby.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:25.950
We might be able to 
find a little food there.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:28.960
Let's go there, then.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.910
Lead the way.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:01.020
Lizards!

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:05.830
Leave this to me.

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:20.870
I defeated them.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.650
Let's all carry Sensui-kun inside.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.760
Help me out.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:39.520
We'll need to set up 
a place where he can rest.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:45.320
<i>Looks like her mother's starting 
to regain her sanity, too.</i>

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.720
<b>"Letter of Farewell"</b>
